  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 805.04 Radium 226 and Radium 228",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 805.04 Radium 226 and Radium 228. For radium 226 or radium 228 violations, the statement shall read as follows:\n\n“Some people who drink water containing radium 226 or radium 228 in excess of the MCL over many years may have an increased risk of getting cancer.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 800) #9730, eff 6-30-10; ss by #12675, eff 1-1-19",
